## User

How many times a number occurs in a list.

## Context

```agda
_≡ᵇ_ : ℕ → ℕ → Bool
```

## Type

type
```agda
countOcc : ℕ → List ℕ → ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
countOcc zero    []       = 0
countOcc zero    (x ∷ xs) = 1
countOcc (suc n) (x ∷ xs) = countOcc n xs + x
```

## agda

```agda
countOcc-lemma : (n : ℕ) (xs : List ℕ) → countOcc n xs ≡ countOcc n xs + countOcc n xs
```

## agda

```agda
countOcc-lemma zero    []       = refl
countOcc-lemma zero    (x ∷ xs) = refl
countOcc-lemma (suc n) (x ∷ xs) =
  countOcc-lemma n xs + countOcc-lemma n xs
```

